vLLM XPU Arc extensions

This repository contains Apache-2.0 derived work and patches for:

* vLLM, upstream commit ac7509e2b1db40fec2f03dde1ed4e9dfdc2338c9.
* vllm-gguf-plugin, upstream main commit d4c1f0d082fc7cd4350da56689109a01c1f29d6c,
  with the XPU extension commit 56bfc18.
* oneDNN APIs and build integration. The oneDNN source is an external build
  dependency and is not vendored here.

